    "name": "Warlocked",
    "steam_appid": 3470180,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A talking Cat. Magical Powers. A stolen artifact. A resetting time-loop. An army of enemies.</i> <i>Oh - and you've just been dropped out of a strange tank: slimy, wet, and with no memories.</i><br><br><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i><strong>Where to begin?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470180/extras/bb3a9dbe15eb298ce60373b71b2cf02f.poster.avif?t=1742754474\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470180/extras/bb3a9dbe15eb298ce60373b71b2cf02f.webm?t=1742754474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470180/extras/bb3a9dbe15eb298ce60373b71b2cf02f.mp4?t=1742754474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Warlocked</strong></i> is a fast-paced action rogue-like game with extraction elements where you create the spells that you use to destroy, freeze, electrocute, or incinerate anything that stands in your way as you attempt to free yourself from the wrath of a King hell-bent on your destruction. Journey through six unique regions, defeating swaths of enemies and bosses on your mission to<strong> Kill The King.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR SPELLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470180/extras/b73f3db85faeb17496068f52bd542a3a.poster.avif?t=1742754474\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470180/extras/b73f3db85faeb17496068f52bd542a3a.webm?t=1742754474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470180/extras/b73f3db85faeb17496068f52bd542a3a.mp4?t=1742754474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With nearly <strong><i>limitless</i></strong> potential, combine up to 9 runes to augment the spells that you use. With each run being completely unique, you're always guaranteed to discover new and exciting combinations to <strong>wreak havoc</strong> with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR STOCKPILE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470180/extras/4378199df4f679732acfa821ab278745.poster.avif?t=1742754474\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470180/extras/4378199df4f679732acfa821ab278745.webm?t=1742754474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470180/extras/4378199df4f679732acfa821ab278745.mp4?t=1742754474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's an entire world out there, fresh and brimming with loot each and every time you leave the safety of your tower. <strong>Stockpile</strong> your surplus items when you can, taking equipment on future runs and using materials to craft and upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE YOUR CLONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470180/extras/0af3d270cdb6ec795cabd6ceaefb2d97.poster.avif?t=1742754474\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470180/extras/0af3d270cdb6ec795cabd6ceaefb2d97.webm?t=1742754474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470180/extras/0af3d270cdb6ec795cabd6ceaefb2d97.mp4?t=1742754474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may have started this life weak, wet, and naked - but that doesn't always have to be the case! Well...at least the weak part. With the power of <strong><i>science</i></strong>, you too can have the strength of a hardened soldier, or the dexterity of a nimble archer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(If you're willing to get your hands dirty and collect a few<i> </i>&quot;<i>tissue sample</i>s&quot;, that is)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER NEW FRIENDSHIPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470180/extras/789368c3b669ae984003b47614c7c13a.poster.avif?t=1742754474\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470180/extras/789368c3b669ae984003b47614c7c13a.webm?t=1742754474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470180/extras/789368c3b669ae984003b47614c7c13a.mp4?t=1742754474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a cast of colorful characters including a magic mirror, an undead blacksmith, a mysterious purveyor of magical items inexplicable in nature whose very being defies the known laws of science and magic, and your very own <strong>magical cat</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470180/extras/95b5604599fc9a6b970249582d33a1e4.avif?t=1742754474\" data-has-big width=800 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're wanting to stay on top of the latest news, join the next playtest, discuss what you've pondered with your scrying orb today, or just be a silent lurker - the<i><strong> Warlocked Discord </strong></i>Is your one-stop shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A talking Cat. Magical Powers. A stolen artifact. A resetting time-loop. An army of enemies.</i> <i>Oh - and you've just been dropped out of a strange tank: slimy, wet, and with no memories.</i><br><br><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i><strong>Where to begin?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470180/extras/bb3a9dbe15eb298ce60373b71b2cf02f.poster.avif?t=1742754474\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470180/extras/bb3a9dbe15eb298ce60373b71b2cf02f.webm?t=1742754474\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470180/extras/bb3a9dbe15eb298ce60373b71b2cf02f.mp4?t=1742754474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Warlocked</strong></i> is a fast-paced action rogue-like game with extraction elements where you create the spells that you use to destroy, freeze, electrocute, or incinerate anything that stands in your way as you attempt to free yourself from the wrath of a King hell-bent on your destruction. Journey through six unique regions, defeating swaths of enemies and bosses on your mission to<strong> Kill The King.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR SPELLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470180/extras/b73f3db85faeb17496068f52bd542a3a.poster.avif?t=1742754474\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a