tn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470180/extras/95b5604599fc9a6b970249582d33a1e4.avif?t=1742754474\" data-has-big width=800 height=123 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're wanting to stay on top of the latest news, join the next playtest, discuss what you've pondered with your scrying orb today, or just be a silent lurker - the<i><strong> Warlocked Discord </strong></i>Is your one-stop shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
